    "raw_output": "```python\nfrom typing import Optional\n\ndef token_bucket_trace(capacity: int, initial: int, refill: int, costs: list[int]) -> Optional[list[int]]:\n    if capacity <= 0:\n        return None\n    if initial < 0:\n        return None\n    if initial > capacity:\n        return None\n    if not costs:\n        return [initial]\n    \n    tokens = initial\n    result = []\n    \n    for i, cost in enumerate(costs):\n        if cost < 0:\n            return None\n        \n        if i == 0:\n            # First request: no refill, just check cost\n            if tokens >= cost:\n                tokens -= cost\n                result.append(tokens)\n            else:\n                result.append(-(tokens + 1))\n        else:\n            # Subsequent requests: refill, then check cost\n            tokens = min(capacity, tokens + refill)\n            if tokens >= cost:\n                tokens -= cost\n                result.append(tokens)\n            else:\n                result.append(-(tokens + 1))\n    \n    return result\n```<|im_end|>",
